Description: Pannagram builds reference-free linear pangenome alignments and
    analyzes genomic polymorphisms. It provides a command-line interface for
    whole-genome alignment, feature extraction (SNPs, structural variants, and
    mobile element families), and similarity search, together with an R library
    for downstream analysis and visualization.
